    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1291640/extras/0ede950326c0c3814bfea6b4a0b33fca.poster.avif?t=1663933211\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1291640/extras/0ede950326c0c3814bfea6b4a0b33fca.webm?t=1663933211\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1291640/extras/0ede950326c0c3814bfea6b4a0b33fca.mp4?t=1663933211\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>In modern society, the stress that plagues many people ...<br>It has piled up and has reached the limit of this star! !<br><br>Yeah ... it's time to explode the massive amount of stress that has accumulated in you! !<br><br>The cause of stress that hides in everyday life,<br>By destroying, messing up and exploding,<br>Save this world from stress! !<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1291640/extras/21cec3aeddc2de412fc2dbf0b31d9e3f.poster.avif?t=1663933211\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1291640/extras/21cec3aeddc2de412fc2dbf0b31d9e3f.webm?t=1663933211\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1291640/extras/21cec3aeddc2de412fc2dbf0b31d9e3f.mp4?t=1663933211\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>This is a 2D action game with a refreshing feeling of destruction in various everyday situations.<br>The purpose of the game is to destroy the bosses prepared for all stages while collecting &quot;love fragments&quot; and &quot;money&quot; while aiming for a high score in each stage.<br>The protagonist is a person who is trapped in modern stress and fights against various stresses such as daily life, time, company, boss, and noise.<br>The game world is represented by a funny, cute, hand-drawn dot picture.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1291640/extras/7f7baaef4f97c01d02aa31b9a87b23b3.poster.avif?t=1663933211\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1291640/extras/7f7baaef4f97c01d02aa31b9a87b23b3.webm?t=1663933211\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1291640/extras/7f7baaef4f97c01d02aa31b9a87b23b3.mp4?t=1663933211\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br> * Operate the hero to destroy everything.<br><br> * When you destroy something, hero's voltage rises and stress is released.<br><br> * Destroy the boss, which is the source of stress, and clear the stage.<br><br> * The situations and places that the hero faces will be unlocked.<br><br> * Each stage, get a high score, collect &quot;fragments of love&quot; and &quot;money&quot;.<br><br> * Achieve the &quot;challenge&quot; prepared for each stage and collect &quot;happy clovers&quot;.<br><br> * Build trees, stones, and buildings on the MAP to raise the hero's status.<br><br> * Anyway, let's blow everything up with stress.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1291640/extras/c23c43034b930e68fdbc35338bb7af1d.poster.avif?t=1663933211\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1291640/extras/c23c43034b930e68fdbc35338bb7af1d.webm?t=1663933211\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br><br>When you've blown out all the stress...<br>May peace come to the world and you.",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1291640/extras/0ede950326c0c3814bfea6b4a0b33fca.poster.avif?t=1663933211\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1291640/extras/0ede950326c0c3814bfea6b4a0b33fca.webm?t=1663933211\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1291640/extras/0ede950326c0c3814bfea6b4a0b33fca.mp4?t=1663933211\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>In modern society, the stress that plagues many people ...<br>It has piled up and has reached the limit of this star! !<br><br>Yeah ... it's time to explode the massive amount of stress that has accumulated in you! !<br><br>The cause of stress that hides in everyday life,<br>By destroying, messing up and exploding,<br>Save this world from stress! !<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1291640/extras/21cec3aeddc2de412fc2dbf0b31d9e3f.poster.avif?t=1663933211\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1291640/extras/21cec3aeddc2de412fc2dbf0b31d9e3f.webm?t=1663933211\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1291640/extras/21cec3aeddc2de412fc2dbf0b31d9e3f.mp4?t=1663933211\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>This is a 2D action game with a refreshing feeling of destruction in various everyday situations.<br>The purpose of the game is to destroy the bosses prepared for all stages while collecting &quot;love fragments&quot; and &quot;money&quot; while aiming for a high score in each stage.<br>The protagonist is a person who is trapped in modern stress and fights against various stresses such as daily life, time, company, boss, and noise.<br>The game world is represented by a funny, cute, hand-drawn dot picture.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1291640/extras/7f7baaef4f97c01d02aa31b9a87b23b3.poster.avif?t=1663933211\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1291640/extras/7f7baaef4f97c01d02aa31b9a87b23b3.webm?t=1663933211\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1291640/extras/7f7baaef4f97c01d02aa31b9a87b23b3.mp4?t=1663933211\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br> * Operate the hero to destroy everything.<br><br> * When you destroy something, hero's voltage rises and stress is released.<br><br> * Destroy the boss, which is the source of stress, and clear the stage.<br><br> * The situations and places that the hero faces will be unlocked.<br><br> * Each stage, get a high score, collect &quot;fragments of love&quot; and &quot;money&quot;.<br><br> * Achieve the &quot;challenge&quot; prepared for each stage and collect &quot;happy clovers&quot;.<br><br> * Build trees, stones, and buildings on the MAP to raise the hero's status.<br><br> * Anyway, let's blow everything up with stress.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1291640/extras/c23c43034b930e68fdbc35338bb7af1d.poster.avif?t=1663933211\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1291640/extras/c23c43034b930e68fdbc35338bb7af1d.webm?t=1663933211\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br><br>When you've blown out all the stress...<br>May peace come to the world and you.",
